{
  "type": "minecraft:notice",
  "title": {
    "text": "Quest 2 of 12",
    "font": "tut:clean",
    "color": "gold",
    "bold": true
  },
  "external_title": {
    "text": "Quest 2",
    "font": "tut:clean"
  },
  "pause": false,
  "can_close_with_escape": true,
  "after_action": "close",
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 320,
      "contents": {
        "text": "",
        "font": "tut:clean",
        "color": "white",
        "extra": [
          {
            "text": "/give + Command Blocks",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "gold"
          },
          {
            "text": "\n\n"
          },
          {
            "text": "",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "white",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Take the command block out of your inventory and place it on the ground. ",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "Right-click",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": " it to open it.",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "\n\n"
          },
          {
            "text": "",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "white",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": "The big box at the top is where the command goes. ",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "No slash needed",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": " - the block already knows it's a command.",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "\n\n"
          },
          {
            "text": "",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "white",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": "One catch: ",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "@s",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": " means whoever runs the command. In a block, that's the block! Use ",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "@p",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": " instead - it means the ",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "nearest player",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": ", and that's you.",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "\n\n"
          },
          {
            "text": "",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "white",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Your Mission",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": " - Open the block and type ",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "give @p carrot",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": " in the box. You should see three boxes side by side right above the ",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "Done",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": " and ",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "Cancel",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": " boxes at the bottom.",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "\n\n"
          },
          {
            "text": "",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "white",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": "These three boxes set options for how command blocks work. Change the box all the way to the right to say ",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "Always Active",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": " instead of ",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "Needs Redstone",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": ". Leave the other ones (the left box should say ",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "Impulse",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": ", and the center box should say ",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "Unconditional",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": "). Then click ",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "Done",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": ".",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "\n\n"
          },
          {
            "text": "",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "white",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Do you have a carrot in your inventory? If so, you've completed the quest! ",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "bold": false,
            "color": "white"
          },
          {
            "text": "\n\n"
          },
          {
            "text": "",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "white",
            "bold": false
          },
          {
            "text": "The next quest starts as soon as you've done it.",
            "font": "tut:clean",
            "color": "yellow",
            "bold": false
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "action": {
    "label": {
      "text": "Continue",
      "font": "tut:clean",
      "color": "green"
    }
  }
}
